{"data": [{"author_id": "1308990535357652993", "created_at": "2026-10-31T15:01:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116545999774843255"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/TKe8zyIFRk", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/kumawataman13/status/2116545999774843255/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116545972641857537", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/TKe8zyIFRk"}]}, "id": "2116545999774843255", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 96, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "NVIDIA only designs the chip; it doesn't manufacture it.\n\nLet's break down the complete semiconductor ecosystem and understand what each company does.\n\n(1) Chip Architecture &amp; Design\n\nCompanies: NVIDIA, AMD\n\nThese companies design the chip architecture, including GPU cores, https://t.co/TKe8zyIFRk", "url": "https://x.com/kumawataman13/status/2116545999774843255"}, {"author_id": "1412045422483283971", "created_at": "2026-10-31T04:09:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116381958313750589"], "id": "2116381958313750589", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 155, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【3.3倍→5.5倍→14倍】CoWoS（コワス）って何？なぜAI半導体の「詰まり」になるの？\n\nCoWoSはTSMCの先端パッケージ技術。GPUとHBM（積み重ねたメモリ）を1枚の「中継板」の上に並べてつなぎます。\n\n中継板の大きさ（露光1回分＝約858mm²の何倍か）\nCoWoS-S 最大3.3倍（約2,700mm²）\nCoWoS-L", "url": "https://x.com/GoToFIRE147755/status/2116381958313750589"}, {"author_id": "1838943895129927680", "created_at": "2026-10-31T02:59:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116364380354871449"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/aH1BWIXgDH", "end": 260, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/QubbleOfficial/status/2116364380354871449/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116364315749961728", "start": 237, "url": "https://t.co/aH1BWIXgDH"}]}, "id": "2116364380354871449", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 50, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "HBM and CoWoS bottlenecks don't just throttle AI training — they stall the validator hardware refresh that would migrate consensus off ECDSA. TSMC price power + packaging queue = structural delay baked into the trust layer. Per SemiEng. https://t.co/aH1BWIXgDH", "url": "https://x.com/QubbleOfficial/status/2116364380354871449"}, {"author_id": "1828694705506500608", "created_at": "2026-11-01T20:11:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116986605609300473"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/UoKXys2BH5", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JSCC2020Lee/status/2116986605609300473/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116986598672023552", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/UoKXys2BH5"}]}, "id": "2116986605609300473", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Intel EMIB silicon-bridge embed yield collapses to just 25-30% while TSMC CoWoS holds near 98%, locking packaging as the AI accelerator chokepoint.\n1/ Key Numbers &amp; Facts: • SK hynix 3Q26 revenue ₩104.6155T (~$78B), operating profit ₩83.3338T (~$62B), record 80% margin • HBM https://t.co/UoKXys2BH5", "url": "https://x.com/JSCC2020Lee/status/2116986605609300473"}, {"author_id": "2108191189019381760", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:29:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116885242447642825"], "id": "2116885242447642825", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 303, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Morgan Stanley — Greater China Semiconductors: AI Semi...\nMorgan Stanley — Greater China Semiconductors: AI Semiconductor Supply Chain, Memory, CPO, Quantum Security\nCore conclusion: APAC semiconductor sector view — Attractive. The AI semiconductor demand outlook is strong, but", "url": "https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2116885242447642825"}, {"author_id": "1828694705506500608", "created_at": "2026-10-31T01:52:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116347553184960524"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/eeFIl2IvGt", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JSCC2020Lee/status/2116347553184960524/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116347547593904128", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/eeFIl2IvGt"}]}, "id": "2116347553184960524", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 86, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Amazon holds its $220B 2026 cash capex guide and signals meaningfully higher 2027 spend as AWS capacity is largely sold out into 2028.\n1/ Key Numbers &amp; Facts: • AWS Q3 revenue $46.0B (+39% YoY), annualized run rate ~$184B • Projected AWS growth &gt;40% in both 2027 and 2028 • https://t.co/eeFIl2IvGt", "url": "https://x.com/JSCC2020Lee/status/2116347553184960524"}, {"author_id": "2075042885888790528", "created_at": "2026-10-31T00:10:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116321983038361924"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/dGAuSb5PgG", "end": 150, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/FANGsaikyou/status/2116321983038361924/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116321896136593408", "start": 127, "url": "https://t.co/dGAuSb5PgG"}]}, "id": "2116321983038361924", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 370, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "【半導体初心者講座 #15】\n\n今回は「先端パッケージングとは？」です🔰\n\n先端パッケージングとは、複数の半導体チップを高密度に接続し、性能を引き出す技術のこと。\n\nAI半導体の進化を支える重要な技術として注目されています！\n\n🔹 ① CoWoSとは？ https://t.co/dGAuSb5PgG", "url": "https://x.com/FANGsaikyou/status/2116321983038361924"}, {"article": {"title": "EMIB Bridge Yields Below 30%? Intel May Have to Pay the Bill"}, "author_id": "2094661944410247168", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:03:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116863761424470234"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2116…", "end": 234, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2116862697610588160", "sta