762882581"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 59, "id": "1943306828697550848", "start": 50, "username": "claudeai"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/IsyhK34NGT", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BretKerr/status/2116461711762882581/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116461707778248704", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/IsyhK34NGT"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/IsyhK34NGT", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BretKerr/status/2116461711762882581/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116461707765628928", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/IsyhK34NGT"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/IsyhK34NGT", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BretKerr/status/2116461711762882581/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116461707778224128", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/IsyhK34NGT"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/IsyhK34NGT", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BretKerr/status/2116461711762882581/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116461707757309953", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/IsyhK34NGT"}, {"display_url": "x.com/bretkerr/statu…", "end": 323, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/bretkerr/status/2116452125890732256", "start": 300, "url": "https://t.co/hF3dG2utnZ"}]}, "id": "2116461711762882581", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 177, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116452125890732256", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This morning I posted Clawd Builds Its Own House: @claudeai writes and checks the chip, humans print it. Then I ran it through the bifurcated loop. Gemini mapped the stack. GPT was told to kill it. The caption survived. The floor plan didn't. 🧵\n\nDesign really is speeding up. https://t.co/IsyhK34NGT https://t.co/hF3dG2utnZ", "url": "https://x.com/BretKerr/status/2116461711762882581"}, {"author_id": "1790868238949339137", "created_at": "2026-10-30T22:05:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116290417771806807"], "id": "2116290417771806807", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1107, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "📉 AI 반도체는 부족한데, 공급과잉은 언제 오는가?\nAI SEMICONDUCTOR SUPPLY CYCLE\n\n반도체 시장 심층 분석 3편\n\nAI GPU와 HBM은 여전히 공급이 부족합니다.\n\n그런데 반도체 기업들은 막대한 자금을 투자하며 생산능력을 확대하고 있습니다.\n\n저는 여기서 중요한 질문이 하나 생긴다고 생각합니다.", "url": "https://x.com/jinseongeo83473/status/2116290417771806807"}, {"author_id": "1838186195508969472", "created_at": "2026-11-01T00:08:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116683815653654922"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 6, "start": 0, "tag": "ASMIY"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/50qawNmq58", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheValueist/status/2116683815653654922/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116683773396013056", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/50qawNmq58"}]}, "id": "2116683815653654922", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 3396, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$ASMIY KEY READ-THROUGHS FROM ASM INTERNATIONAL’S Q3 2026 EARNINGS CALL\n\nASM’s October 28 earnings call supports a prolonged, increasingly technology-intensive semiconductor investment cycle, but not an indiscriminate bullish conclusion for every participant. The most valuable https://t.co/50qawNmq58", "url": "https://x.com/TheValueist/status/2116683815653654922"}, {"author_id": "1878424909476761600", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:53:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116513812920647788"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/vrwnACgBMZ", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/vm3jp6u04/status/2116513812920647788/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116512923514249216", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/vrwnACgBMZ"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/vrwnACgBMZ", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/vm3jp6u04/status/2116513812920647788/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116512923518377984", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/vrwnACgBMZ"}]}, "id": "2116513812920647788", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 94, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "CoWoS-L hides small silicon bridges in an RDL interposer, so the finest wiring sits only under chip boundaries. Tech Daily | No. 11 of 16\n\nTSMC says 3.5-reticle CoWoS-L has been in production since 2024. NVIDIA CEO Jensen Huang said Blackwell uses largely CoWoS-L. More in reply. https://t.co/vrwnACgBMZ", "url": "https://x.com/vm3jp6u04/status/2116513812920647788"}, {"author_id": "2058302837587685378", "created_at": "2026-10-31T17:49:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116588414703423579"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/fYtW5vj7Xt", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/AuraConvexity/status/2116588414703423579/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116588385175236609", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/fYtW5vj7Xt"}]}, "id": "2116588414703423579", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 117, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC is about to more than double CoWoS capacity, and it still wants up to 20% more for it.\n\nThat only happens when the real bottleneck is somewhere else.\n\nCoWoS goes from ~106k wafers a month in 2026 to ~227k in 2027, +114% (Goldman)\nA price hike of up to 20% is being weighed, https://t.co/fYtW5vj7Xt", "url": "https://x.com/AuraConvexity/status/2116588414703423579"}, {"author_id": "1930923690604351488", "created_at": "2026-11-01T09:56:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116831675149848986"], "id": "2116831675149848986", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 744, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ว้าวุ่นของจริง!! สื่อไต้หวันรายงานว่า เทคโนโลยี EMIB ของ Intel มีอัตราผลผลิต (Yield) โดยรวมอยู่ที่ประมาณ 60–65% แต่เฉพาะขั้นตอนการฝังชิป Silicon Bridge ลงในแผ่นวงจร ABF Substrate กลับมี Yield เพียง 25–30% เท่านั้น\n\nตัวเลขดังกล่าวต่ำกว่าเทคโนโลยี CoWoS ของ TSMC อย่างมาก ซึ่งมี", "url": "https://x.com/naklongpoong/status/2116831675149848986"}, {"article": {"title": "Reading Anthropic's S-1: Where the Biggest IPO Ever Actually Hits the AI Supply Chain "}, "author_id": "2728929937", "created_at": "2026-10-31T16:24:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116567054530879713"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2116…", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2116367780480188418", "start": 0, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2116367780480188418", "url": "https://t.co/H7UhTwoqUR"}]}, "id": "2116567054530879713", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 624, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/H7UhTwoqUR", "url": "https://x.com/benjaminliang78/status/2116567054530879713"}, {"author_id": "2116862138102726656", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:28:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116870101383237932"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 209, "start": 191, "tag": "AdvancedPackaging"}, {"end": 225, "start": 210, "tag": "Semiconductors"}], "mentions": [{"end": 8, "id": "2803191", "start": 2, "username": "intel"}], "urls": [{"description": "AI chips, memory & high-speed networking, verified. GPUs, ASICs, HBM/DRAM, NAND & SSD controllers, switches, CPO, foundry & packaging. Every item checked on primary sources.", "display_url": "t.me/SiliconBriefAI", "end": 257, "expanded_url": "https://t.me/SiliconBriefAI", "images": [{"height": 320, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116863342187106304/4FBLjGPd?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 320}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116863342187106304/4FBLjGPd?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 234, "status": 200, "title": "@SiliconBriefAI", "unwound_url": "https://t.me/SiliconBriefAI", "url": "https://t.co/4oiYNpAdgp"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/vlgUthSkN0", "end": 281, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SiliconBriefAI/status/2116870101383237932/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116870088431226880", "start": 258, "url": "https://t.co/vlgUthSkN0"}]}, "id": "2116870101383237932", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🧩 @intel EMIB yields: investors cited by Economic Daily News put overall yield at ~60-65%, and 25-30% for embedding bridges in ABF substrates.\nTSMC CoWoS: ~98%, still the main supply source.\n#AdvancedPackaging #Semiconductors\n\nMore 👉 https://t.co/4oiYNpAdgp https://t.co/vlgUthSkN0", "url": "https://x.com/SiliconBriefAI/status/2116870101383237932"}, {"author_id": "2955103020", "created_at": "2026-11-01T11:59:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116862762466836632"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 153, "start": 148, "tag": "INTC"}, {"end": 171, "start": 167, "tag": "TSM"}]}, "id": "2116862762466836632", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 105, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Pre-Market Wire\n\nIntel's EMIB packaging reportedly yields 60-65% overall, but only 25-30% on the bridge-embedding step vs about 98% for TSMC CoWoS. $INTC isn't a real $TSM alternative yet.\n\nIran talks hit day 3 in Doha. The UAE says Hormuz must go back to how it was before 28", "url": "https://x.com/JayHCapital/status/2116862762466836632"}, {"author_id": "186611769", "created_at": "2026-11-01T18:14:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116957145669444090"], "id": "2116957145669444090", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 333, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "기타 : Anthropic S-1 심층 분석   \n\nQ3.2026 실적 분석 완료한 기업                \n\n1. 실적레포트(11개) : 마이크론, ASML, TSMC, SpaceX, 테슬라, 메타, 넷플릭스, SK 하이닉스, 구글, 마소, 아마존            \n\n2. 실적분석 강의영상(3개) : 마이크론, ASML, TSMC  \n\nQ2.2026 실적 분석 완료한", "url": "https://x.com/PForever0000/status/2116957145669444090"}, {"author_id": "1629666103701147648", "created_at": "2026-10-31T18:03:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116591940968087833", "2116592029144854753"], "id": "2116591940968087833", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "决定性地证伪\"AI需求泡沫破裂\"。\n\n被质疑的是出钱方的自由现金流，不是需求本身\n\n实物需求的独立验证：\n\n韩国 10/1–20 半导体出口 +222.5% y/y（占出口44.7%）、\n\n台湾 9月 ICT 外销订单 +87.3%、\n\nAWS +39.3%（连续六季加速）、\n\nAzure +48%、\n\nGoogle Cloud +103%、\n\n铠侠 CY2027 产能全部售罄、", "url": "https://x.com/SeaOcean211/status/2116591940968087833"}, {"author_id": "2102021903720353792", "created_at": "2026-10-31T15:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116545733570490496"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 180, "start": 175, "tag": "NVDA"}, {"end": 185, "start": 181, "tag": "TSM"}, {"end": 191, "start": 186, "tag": "ASML"}], "urls": [{"description": "EX-1.01 2 a2026conflictmineralsrepor.htm EX-1.01 for the Calendar Year Ended December 31, 2025 This Conflict Minerals Report of NVIDIA Corporation, a Delaware corporation, is being filed for the calendar year ended December 31, 2025 in compliance with Rule 13p-1 of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934, as amended. The use of conflict minerals necessary to the functionality or production of products NVIDIA contracted to be manufactured between January 1, 2025 and December 31, 2025, or the Reporting Period,", "display_url": "sec.gov/Archives/edgar…", "end": 225, "expanded_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1045810/000104581026000043/a2026conflictmineralsrepor.htm", "start": 202, "status": 200, "title": "Document", "unwound_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1045810/000104581026000043/a2026conflictmineralsrepor.htm", "url": "https://t.co/Fgy4KvAen7"}, {"description": "Established in 1987 by Dr. Morris Chang, TSMC (TWSE: 2330, NYSE: TSM) pioneered the pure-play foundry business model with an exclusive focus on manufacturing its customers’ products. In 2025, the Company manufactured 12,682 different products using 305 distinct technologies for 534 different customers for various applications covering a variety of end markets including high performance computing (HPC), smartphones, the Internet of Things (IoT), automotive, and digital consumer electronics (DCE). Annual", "display_url": "tsmc.com/english/aboutT…", "end": 249, "expanded_url": "https://www.tsmc.com/english/aboutTSMC/company_profile", "images": [{"height": 360, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116545783398895617/CXz6h_Oe?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 500}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116545783398895617/CXz6h_Oe?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 226, "status": 200, "title": "Company Info - Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Company Limited", "unwound_url": "https://www.tsmc.com/english/aboutTSMC/company_profile", "url": "https://t.co/ztIzEy1cpv"}, {"description": "Learn all about ASML, the world's leading supplier for the semiconductor industry, including how we work, what we do and how you can join us.", "display_url": "asml.com/en/company/abo…", "end": 273, "expanded_url": "https://www.asml.com/en/company/about-asml", "start": 250, "status": 200, "title": "About ASML - The world's supplier for the semiconductor industry", "unwound_url": "https://www.asml.com/en/company/about-asml", "url": "https://t.co/v2OXBYz28F"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/8Dw2uWkWL7", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/verdictclub/status/2116545733570490496/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116523283428343808", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/8Dw2uWkWL7"}]}, "id": "2116545733570490496", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "NVIDIA designs processors. TSMC manufactures chips for customers. ASML makes lithography equipment.\n\nI'd look at them as three businesses, with different customers and risks. $NVDA $TSM $ASML\n\nSources:\nhttps://t.co/Fg